{"id":"2094787805947999182","kind":"article","title":"计算机优化：你的计算机比你想的还要快","author":"Gwern Branwen","original_authors":["Gwern Branwen"],"original_source_urls":["https://gwern.net/note/faster"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Gwern Branwen","date":"2026-10-17","updated":"2026-10-29","votes":62,"comment_count":1,"minutes":11,"chars":5502,"keywords":["算法优化","软件工程","算法基准测试","算法设计","强化学习","深度强化学习"],"summary":"Gwern以一份不断扩展的案例链接汇编，展示算法改进、贴合现代硬件的实现和端到端系统设计如何带来数量级的速度提升；案例涵盖数据处理、网络、强化学习、游戏与存储等。末尾还用小团队运行大型服务的例子讨论组织效率。文章是主题索引和说明性案例集，并非统一条件下的性能实验，也不意味着任意程序都能达到相同加速幅度。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2094787805947999182","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"脚注"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"jRqfILrS\">这些文章和案例研究表明，只要改进算法，充分利用现代硬件，并关注整个系统的设计，软件运行速度往往能提升十倍甚至更多。</p><hr/><blockquote data-pid=\"-LAttV4H\">等你证明自己懂得怎么用好第一台计算机了，你才能拥有第二台。<br/><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/cs/algorithm/2015-mcsherry.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Paul Barham，引自“可扩展性！但代价是什么？”</a></blockquote><ul><li data-pid=\"esccwuxa\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tacit_knowledge\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">隐性知识</a> / <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://dzone.com/articles/mechanical-sympathy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">机械同理心</a></li><li data-pid=\"WUJdXJ2G\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://herbsutter.com/welcome-to-the-jungle/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“欢迎来到丛林”</a>（探讨 CPU 设计与摩尔定律；参见<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/computers\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“你的计算机里有多少台计算机？”</a>）<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"0zKdK_lm\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/cs/hardware/2020-leiserson.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“顶层还有很大空间：摩尔定律之后是什么在推动计算机性能？”</a>，Leiserson 等人，2020 年（探讨基于<b><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/cs/end-to-end-principle/index\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">端到端原则</a></b>的系统设计所带来的收益[1]）</li><li data-pid=\"6D0SeaGH\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/cs/algorithm/2015-mcsherry.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“可扩展性！但代价是什么？”</a>，McSherry 等人，2015 年（探讨笔记本电脑性能超越集群的情况：良好基准测试的重要性；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://shkspr.mobi/blog/2021/04/whats-the-origin-of-the-phrase-big-data-doesnt-fit-in-excel/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“大数据”装不进笔记本</a>）；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://adamdrake.com/command-line-tools-can-be-235x-faster-than-your-hadoop-cluster.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“命令行工具比你的 Hadoop 集群快 235 倍”</a></li><li data-pid=\"xSJPxIkG\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://nickcraver.com/blog/2013/11/22/what-it-takes-to-run-stack-overflow/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“运行 Stack Overflow 需要什么”</a>，Nick Craver；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://world.hey.com/dhh/we-stand-to-save-7m-over-five-years-from-our-cloud-exit-53996caa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“退出云服务，我们在 5 年内能省下 700 万美元”</a>，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Heinemeier_Hansson\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">David Heinemeier Hansson</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://thume.ca/2023/01/02/one-machine-twitter/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“在一台机器上跑推特生产环境？100Gbps 网卡和 NVMe 确实很快”</a></li><li data-pid=\"WEf21DWJ\"><a href=\"https:&lt;code&gt;//arstechnica.co&lt;/code&gt;m/information-technology/2013/05/how-crackers-make-minced-meat-out-of-your-passwords/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“黑客剖析：破解者如何洗劫像 qeadzcwrsfxv1331 这样的密码；三名破解者为 Ars 破解了 16000 多个哈希密码，成功率达 90%”</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wooo.sh/adler32.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“以 41 GB/s 的速度计算 Adler32 校验和”</a></li><li data-pid=\"-gPwegrh\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://cacm.acm.org/research/the-science-of-brute-force/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“暴力破解的科学”</a></li><li data-pid=\"gi3p8MJ3\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://code.visualstudio.com/blogs/2021/09/29/bracket-pair-colorization\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“括号配对成色速度提升 10000 倍”</a></li><li data-pid=\"MqmV8-1d\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1902.08318\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“每秒解析 GB 级 JSON”</a>，Langdale 与 Lemire，2019 年</li><li data-pid=\"BaO2Vzu1\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://codegolf.stackexchange.com/questions/215216/high-throughput-fizz-buzz/236630#236630\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">59 GB/s 的 FizzBuzz</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://itnext.io/modern-storage-is-plenty-fast-it-is-the-apis-that-are-bad-6a68319fbc1a\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“现代存储已经够快了，烂的是 API”</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://x.c&lt;code&gt;om/axboe/status/&lt;/code&gt;1452689372395053062\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“单物理核达成 1000 万 IOPS。#io_uring #linux”</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://tanelpoder.com/posts/11m-iops-with-10-ssds-on-amd-threadripper-pro-workstation/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“单台 ThreadRipper 工作站实现 1100 万 IOPS 和 66 GB/s 的 IO”</a></li><li data-pid=\"eaLge1oD\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://www.kegel.com/c10k.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“C10K 问题”</a>，Kegel，2001 年；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://papers.freebsd.org/2021/eurobsdcon/gallatin-netflix-freebsd-400gbps/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“在 FreeBSD 上以 50 GB/s 分发 Netflix 视频”</a>，Gallatin，2021 年 / <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://nabstreamingsummit.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/2022-Streaming-Summit-Netflix.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“以 100 GB/s 甚至更高的速度分发 Netflix 视频流量”</a>，Gallatin，2022 年</li><li data-pid=\"nS2Y2EKX\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://signalsandthreads.com/multicast-and-the-markets/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“多播与市场”</a>（探讨高频交易中的网络优化与机械同理心）</li><li data-pid=\"37MroTx3\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/RoyG2GwYAwoka47Ht/true-stories-of-algorithmic-improvement\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“算法改进的真实故事”</a></li><li data-pid=\"WQjs1vL5\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://auphonic.com/blog/2018/06/01/codec2-podcast-on-floppy-disk/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">结合 Codec2 与 WaveNet 解码器，为微型播客提供超低码率音频（1 小时 = 1MB）</a></li><li data-pid=\"ME9d0OAi\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://shvbsle.in/computers-are-fast-but-you-dont-know-it-p1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“计算机很快，但你并不知道”</a>（用并行化 C++ 替换速度缓慢的 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/pandas_(software)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pandas</a>，速度提升 6000 倍）</li><li data-pid=\"AjtWfefk\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://use.expensify.com/blog/scaling-sqlite-to-4m-qps-on-a-single-server\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“在单台服务器上将 SQLite 扩展至 400 万 QPS（EC2 与裸机对比）”</a>，Expensify；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://sqlite-users.sqlite.narkive.com/CVRvSKBs/50-faster-than-3-7-17\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“比 3.7.17 块 50%”</a>（“……我们通过数百项微优化实现了这一目标。每项微优化带来的性能提升可能只有区区 0.05%。”）</li><li data-pid=\"-VzdPmUQ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://tinkering.xyz/fmo-optimization-story/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“优化故事——量子力学模拟提速”</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://james.hiebert.name/blog/work/2015/09/14/CS-FTW.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“提速 14000 倍，即计算机科学大获全胜”</a></li><li data-pid=\"jYwqCYD3\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/cs/algorithm/2012-frykholm.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“缩短管线：实现亚秒级的迭代时间”</a>，Frykholm，2012 年（探讨游戏开发优化）</li><li data-pid=\"57Ecv1Lv\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://fabiensanglard.net/quake_asm_optimizations/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“Michael Abrash 如何让《雷神之锤》的帧率翻倍”</a>，Fabien Sanglard，2026 年</li><li data-pid=\"Ht-osjIf\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://questdb.io/blog/billion-row-challenge-step-by-step/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“十亿行挑战（1BRC）：Java 版如何步步优化从 71 秒降至 1.7 秒”</a>（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://benhoyt.com/writings/go-1brc/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Go 语言需 4 秒</a>，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://github.com/gunnarmorling/1brc/discussions/710\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">C 语言仅需 0.5 秒</a>）</li><li data-pid=\"Cx5NkHyX\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://ashvardanian.com/posts/gcc-12-vs-avx512fp16/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“GCC 编译器对决人类——手写汇编快 119 倍 💻🆚🧑‍💻”</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://ashvardanian.com/posts/python-c-assembly-comparison/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“Python、C、汇编——余弦相似度计算提速 2500 倍 📐”</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://blog.mattstuchlik.com/2024/07/12/summing-integers-fast.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“在 Haswell 架构上以近乎 memcpy 的速度对 ASCII 编码整数求和”</a>（“比下面这种朴素的 C++ 解法快 320 倍”）</li><li data-pid=\"fN4-5VkZ\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/write\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“如何让 Python 程序提速 114000 倍”</a>，David Schachter，2012 年 12 月 4 日</li><li data-pid=\"J1p6swOf\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.mattkeeter.com/projects/prospero/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“普洛斯彼罗挑战”</a>（渲染一种矢量图形玩具语言；简单实现需 15000 毫秒 → 3750 毫秒 → 6.3 毫秒 → <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.mattkeeter.com/research/mpr/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3.9 毫秒</a>，总计提速 3800 倍）</li><li data-pid=\"w9wXL-KI\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://github.com/ridiculousfish/libdivide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">libdivide：“在当下的 CPU 上，64 位整数除法可提速近 10 倍，32 位整数除法可提速近 5 倍”</a></li><li data-pid=\"9Py43dMu\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.colino.net/wordpress/en/archives/2025/09/28/optimizing-a-6502-image-decoder-from-70-minutes-to-1-minute/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“优化 MOS 6502 CPU 的 Apple 图像解码器，将时间从 70 分钟缩短至 1 分钟”</a></li><li data-pid=\"luElo_5q\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://research.swtch.com/boolean\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“最小布尔公式”</a>，Russ Cox</li><li data-pid=\"CN1_qVG8\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://ashvardanian.com/posts/search-utf8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“利用 AVX-512 实现全 Unicode 搜索，速度是 ICU 的 50 倍”</a></li><li data-pid=\"DOoZiEL-\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.23228\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“mold：一款大规模并行链接器”</a>，Ueyama，2026 年</li><li data-pid=\"e5-3GS51\"><b><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demoscene\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demoscene（演示场景）</a></b>：</li><ul><li data-pid=\"tUtG9B4w\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/write\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“8088 统治”</a>：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://trixter.oldskool.org/2014/06/19/8088-domination-post-mortem-part-1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“我是如何创作出这款在 1981 年的 IBM PC 上播放相当清晰的全动态视频程序的”</a> / <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://trixter.oldskool.org/2014/06/20/8088-domination-post-mortem-conclusion/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">第二部分</a></li><li data-pid=\"yVIpQsZy\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://linusakesson.net/scene/a-mind-is-born/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“意识诞生”</a>（大小仅 256 字节；作为对比，上面那条链接到该演示的 Markdown 源码就有 194 字节长，而演示视频更高达数百万字节）</li></ul><li data-pid=\"y-nyxoa5\">Casey Muratori：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://github.com/cmuratori/refterm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">refterm v2</a>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ge3aKEmZcqY\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《见证者》（Witness）的寻路算法</a>（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/programming/comments/q76ea8/simple_code_high_performance_lecture_by_casey/hghky4o/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">总结</a>）</li><li data-pid=\"8tMI2b06\"><b><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/economics/experience-curve/index\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">算法进展</a></b>：</li><ul><li data-pid=\"EiUajktE\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/ai/scaling/2013-grace.pdf#miri\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“6 个领域的算法进展”</a>，Grace，2013 年</li><li data-pid=\"GBINQRkj\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2008.02215\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“SAT 求解的时间跳跃挑战”</a>，Fichte 等人，2020 年（硬件过剩：自 2000 年以来，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boolean_satisfiability_problem#Algorithms_for_solving_SAT\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SAT 求解</a>性能提升了约 2.5 倍，软件和硬件进步各占一半，不过软件略多一些——在旧硬件上运行新软件，胜过在新硬件上运行旧软件。）</li><li data-pid=\"wOByGBw2\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/self-decrypting#unlocking-of-lcs35\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2019 年破解 LCS35 挑战</a></li><li data-pid=\"K8lftvmv\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/75dnjiD8kv2khe9eQ/measuring-hardware-overhang\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“衡量硬件过剩”</a>，hippke（“如果使用如今的算法，计算机早在 1994 年就能在一台当时的台式机上击败国际象棋世界冠军”）</li></ul><li data-pid=\"N8MA4pY5\"><b>内存局部性</b>：</li><ul><li data-pid=\"Kgc7NebZ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/cs/hardware/2007-drepper.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“每个程序员都该懂的内存知识”</a>，Drepper，2007 年</li><li data-pid=\"nu6H8YmC\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://queue.acm.org/detail.cfm?id=1814327\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“你做错了：以为自己已经掌握了服务器性能的艺术？再想想吧。”</a>，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poul-Henning_Kamp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Poul-Henning Kamp</a>，2010 年（探讨如何使用<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cache-oblivious_algorithm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">缓存无关</a>的 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/B-heap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">B-堆结构</a>将 Varnish 性能优化 10 倍）</li><li data-pid=\"uoVG0lKG\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://martinfowler.com/articles/lmax.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“LMAX 架构”</a>，Fowler，2011 年（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://github.com/tigerbeetle/tigerbeetle/blob/main/docs/DESIGN.md#architecture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TigerBeetle</a>）</li><li data-pid=\"ITS76YKz\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://josephg.com/blog/crdts-go-brrr/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“将 CRDT 提速 5000 倍：一场优化的冒险”</a></li><li data-pid=\"qt8J4cs8\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2009.13569\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“原地超标量样本排序（IPS4o）：工程化原地（共享内存）排序算法”</a>，Axtmann 等人，2020 年；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.05982#google\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“向量化且性能可移植的快速排序”</a>，Blacher 等人，2022 年</li><li data-pid=\"w_uzzGQI\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wolfgarbe.medium.com/fast-approximate-string-matching-with-large-edit-distances-in-big-data-2015-9174a0968c0b\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“大数据中具有大编辑距离的快速近似字符串匹配（2015）”</a></li><li data-pid=\"S7HWsuE2\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1905.13415\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"