JAX 扩展 MiniGrid 环境”</a></li><li data-pid=\"8NmgJTWN\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.12983\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“并行 Q 学习（PQL）：在大规模并行模拟下扩展离线强化学习”</a>，Li 等人，2023 年</li></ul><li data-pid=\"DmSg4OBB\"><b>延迟 / 界面</b>：</li><ul><li data-pid=\"ZlucSzzN\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://www.stuartcheshire.org/rants/latency.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“关键在于延迟，笨蛋。”</a></li><li data-pid=\"vmVan834\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://superuser.com/questions/419070/transatlantic-ping-faster-than-sending-a-pixel-to-the-screen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“跨大西洋 ping 的速度比往屏幕上发送一个像素还快？”</a></li><li data-pid=\"af9mtQhE\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://danluu.com/input-lag/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“计算机延迟：1977—2017”</a></li><li data-pid=\"Cs7nWCte\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://danluu.com/keyboard-latency/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“键盘延迟”</a></li><li data-pid=\"BU8SMBHb\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://danluu.com/term-latency/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“终端延迟”</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://bxt.rs/blog/just-how-much-faster-are-the-gnome-46-terminals/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">改进 GNOME 终端</a></li><li data-pid=\"InzVD_rK\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.inkandswitch.com/local-first.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“本地优先软件：不管有没有云，数据都归你所有”</a> / <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/cs/algorithm/2019-kleppmann.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Kleppmann 等人，2019 年</a></li><li data-pid=\"INfr-fqu\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://danluu.com/web-bloat/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“网页臃肿”</a>[2]</li><li data-pid=\"1SwoZrrJ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/sociology/technology/2021-lawrence.pdf#google\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“Starline 项目：一套高保真网真系统”</a>，Lawrence 等人，2021 年</li><li data-pid=\"eKf53DCY\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.buildt.ai/blog/incorrectusage\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“不按套路使用 GPT-3：成本锐减 40 倍，速度提升 5 倍”</a>，Pullen，2023 年</li><li data-pid=\"oHy5p94s\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/High-frequency_trading#Low-latency_strategies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">高频交易</a>：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210205014443/https://meanderful.blogspot.com/2018/01/the-accidental-hft-firm.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“意外成立的高频交易公司”</a></li><li data-pid=\"p7suSs7y\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shenzhen#Industry\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">深圳</a></li></ul><li data-pid=\"5TmBQEgP\"><b>组织机构</b>：</li><ul><li data-pid=\"KODmW0S2\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WhatsApp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">WhatsApp</a>（2013 年：“50 名员工”服务两亿用户；2015 年：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.wired.com/2015/09/whatsapp-serves-900-million-users-50-engineers/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">50 名“工程师”服务 9 亿用户</a>）</li><li data-pid=\"Ub6ea0Rr\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Craigslist\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Craigslist</a>（2017 年：约 50 名员工）</li><li data-pid=\"lxH-w9rv\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Instagram\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a>（2012 年被 Facebook 收购时：13 名员工；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://read.engineerscodex.com/p/how-instagram-scaled-to-14-million\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">架构</a>）</li><li data-pid=\"_nxzLrJp\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/YouTube\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube</a>（2006 年被谷歌收购时：约 10 名员工）</li><li data-pid=\"QxbmLKc3\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reddit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Reddit</a>（2011 年：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/announcements/comments/efpn0/comment/c17qsmr/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">4 名工程师</a>；2021 年：员工总数约 700 人，超 5200 万用户）</li><li data-pid=\"d-hErclN\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikimedia_Foundation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">维基媒体基金会</a>（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/foundation/1/1e/Wikimedia_Foundation_FY2020-2021_Audit_Report.pdf#page=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2021 年的“互联网托管费”</a>：240 万美元）</li><li data-pid=\"JigF-9ME\">推特：马斯克收购后裁掉了高达 90% 的员工和承包商；推特前员工曾普遍断言该网站会在一两个月内崩溃（甚至是无法恢复的彻底崩溃），结果证明是错的。</li><li data-pid=\"D3o_GbMZ\">另见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://patrickcollison.com/fast\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“一群人共同快速实现宏伟目标的一些案例。”</a></li></ul></ul><blockquote data-pid=\"xbJf8C3Q\">一个新手正试图通过关机再开机，来修好一台出故障的 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lisp_machine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">​Lisp 机器</a>。 <br/>Knight 看见这个学生的举动，严厉地说：“连到底是哪里出了错都没搞懂，你是没法只靠重启电源就把机器修好的。” <br/>说完，Knight 把机器关掉，又开了一次。 <br/>机器修好了。<br/> <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://www.catb.org/jargon/html/koans.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">​“Tom Knight 与 Lisp 机器”</a>，出自<i>《人工智能公案》</i>（AI Koans）</blockquote><h2 id=\"sec-1\">脚注</h2><p data-pid=\"PGwBGlU4\">[1] 哪怕半导体技术停滞，AI 的规模扩张依然能继续，尤其是在<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/tool-ai\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自我优化堆栈</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>的加持下；在谈及 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seymour_Cray\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Seymour Cray</a> 时，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://x.com/ID_AA_Carmack/status/1300280139071270914\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">John Carmack</a> 指出：“如今的超大规模数据中心乃至国家级超级计算机，架构都非常松散。但如果挑战所迫，未来也许会出现十万亿亿次（zettaflops）级别、高度集成、低延迟的计算矩阵，将十亿瓦的功耗全部消散在满满一池子循环流动的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fluorinert\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">氟化液</a>中。”</p><p data-pid=\"OUsKdzZl\">[2] 一个相关的例子是亚马逊给出的托管 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WordPress\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">WordPress</a> 博客的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/best-practices-wordpress/reference-architecture.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“最佳实践”</a>：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-e2dfc0937af25924ee2bea4886e3437a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e2dfc0937af25924ee2bea4886e3437a_r.jpg\" width=\"1556\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"D4llvFY1\">“在 AWS 上托管 WordPress 的参考架构：GitHub 上提供的这套 AWS 托管 WordPress 参考架构概述了在 AWS 上部署 WordPress 的最佳实践，并包含了一套助你快速部署运行的 AWS CloudFormation 模板。下方架构图正是基于该参考架构设计的。本节余下部分将回顾做这些架构选择背后的原因。”</p><hr/><blockquote data-pid=\"TpBLfitd\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 gemini-3.1-pro，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/note/faster\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Computer Optimization: Your Computer Is Faster Than You Think · Gwern.net</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 你的电脑里有多少台电脑？ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"2094799990279370013\" href=\"#/post/2094799990279370013\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 为什么工具 AI 渴望成为智能体 AI <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1994704480931948124\" href=\"#/post/1994704480931948124\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"2081715988400189749","title":"论表达力强大的自然语言是否存在","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":14,"minutes":22,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"2094798951593649206","title":"复杂性并非人工智能的障碍","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":21,"minutes":40,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"1994704480931948124","title":"为什么工具 AI 渴望成为智能体 AI","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":13,"minutes":53,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"2094799990279370013","title":"你的电脑里有多少台电脑？","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":36,"minutes":13,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"2063667653055603557","title":"人工智能需要好奇心吗？","author":"Nate Soares","votes":50,"minutes":7,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「深度强化学习」· Nate Soares"},{"id":"2085671088642696739","title":"Astra 在无显式思维链下展现出令人担忧的高阶计算能力","author":"Neel Nanda","votes":819,"minutes":34,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Neel Nanda"},{"id":"1972234251777840886","title":"创造力、乐趣与内在动机的形式化理论","author":"Jürgen Schmidhuber","votes":30,"minutes":22,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「强化学习」· Jürgen Schmidhuber"},{"id":"692314506","title":"FSRS 是全世界最精确的间隔重复算法之一（最新基准测试更新）","author":"ClarityInMadness","votes":135,"minutes":12,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「算法基准测试」· ClarityInMadness"},{"id":"1907786810685395276","title":"FSRS for Anki 发展史","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":341,"minutes":32,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Jarrett Ye"}],"rec_answers":[]}